    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Multiple active Pricebook2 records per currency (other than the standard pricebook).
Why it matters: Quote lines may pick the wrong pricebook for a currency, especially in multi-currency orgs — pricing becomes inconsistent and depends on the order of pricebook evaluation.
Suppress a finding: when intentional (e.g. segment-specific catalogs).
Disable the detector: only when multi-pricebook-per-currency is by design. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
